ack must block at I5 or E9 to prevent an immediate loss.\nReason: I5 is the best move because it blocks White\'s threat while simultaneously connecting with Black\'s stone at J6 and aligning with column I stones, creating future attacking opportunities. E9 would block but leave Black\'s stone isolated.\nAnswer: {"col": "I", "row": 5}'}
